#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:5
#: 97ff8f1c90b84e0fa9c31e8c8a0b453f
msgid "Downloading and Analyzing Data Logs in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在Mission Planner中下载和分析数据日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:7
#: 08dc6d0bcf674a0ebd18cb2a6b0c1a9b
msgid ""
"Dataflash logs are stored on the autopilot and can be downloaded after a "
"flight. By default, they are created after you first arm the vehicle. This "
"topic explains how to configure and access Dataflash logs."
msgstr "Dataflash日志存储在飞控上，可在飞行后下载。默认情况下，日志在首次解锁后开始记录。本文介绍如何配置和访问Dataflash日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:12
#: 39ace88fa58a439a971d23a0e1373abe
msgid ""
"Depending on the autopilot type and configuration, the dataflash logs may be"
" saved on a SD card, dataflash chip or streamed over MAVLink telemetry "
"ports. The MAVLink option does require a high-speed telemetry port, "
"typically 921600 baud."
msgstr ""
"根据飞控类型和配置，dataflash日志可保存在SD卡、dataflash芯片上，或通过MAVLink数传端口流式传输。MAVLink选项需要高速数传端口，通常为921600波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:14
#: 99ab74c93c7e49429394af89c08ada7e
msgid ""
"In addition to using Mission Planner, many other tools are avaialble to "
"users for log analysis: :ref:`MAVExplorer(part of MAVProxy installation) "
"<using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis>` and :ref:`Web-based tools <common-"
"webtools>`."
msgstr ""
"除使用Mission "
"Planner外，还有许多其他工具可供用户进行日志分析：:ref:`MAVExplorer（MAVProxy安装的一部分）<using-"
"mavexplorer-for-log-analysis>` 和 :ref:`基于网页的工具 <common-webtools>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:18
#: d45934973b8842afa0755e55d300066b
msgid ""
":ref:`Telemetry logs <planner:mission-planner-telemetry-logs>` (also known "
"as \"tlogs\") collect similar information to dataflash logs (see "
":ref:`Diagnosing problems using Logs <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs>` for more information)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`数传日志 <planner:mission-planner-telemetry-logs>` "
"（也称为「tlog」）收集与dataflash日志类似的信息（详见 :ref:`使用日志诊断问题 <common-diagnosing-"
"problems-using-logs>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:20
#: 6d9953157e234397ac9d22767439206f
msgid ""
"If your vehicle is having trouble producing dataflash logs - including the "
"infamous \"No IO heartbeat\" diagnostic message - try a different SD card.  "
"You may also choose to test the card using a dedicated tool, such as "
"``H2testw``.  Low board voltages are also known to cause logging issues."
msgstr ""
"如果您的飞行器在生成dataflash日志时出现问题——包括臭名昭著的「No IO "
"heartbeat」诊断信息——请尝试使用不同的SD卡。您也可以选择使用专用工具（如 "
"``H2testw``）测试SD卡。低板载电压也是已知的导致日志问题的原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:23
#: b7eb70a138f94223be0ac3350abe0ab0
msgid "Logging Parameters"
msgstr "日志记录参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:25
#: d4a5ec70642f49e88c1f165904589010
msgid "Some commonly used parameters are:"
msgstr "一些常用参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:27
#: 7be8bc5c23cb4e66b089bce23aaa31fe
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE<LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>`: Bitmask for where to save logs "
"to. Common values are \"0\" to disable logging, \"1\" (bit 0 set) to log to "
"SD card file, \"2\"(bit 1 set) to stream over MAVLink and \"4\"(bit 2 set) "
"to log to board dataflash memory, if equipped."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE<LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>`：日志保存位置的位掩码。常见值为「0」禁用日志，「1」（bit "
"0置位）记录到SD卡文件，「2」（bit 1置位）通过MAVLink流式传输，「4」（bit 2置位）记录到板载dataflash内存（若有）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:28
#: 7bd6811af9634d15babae8d738c16941
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>`: Bitmask for what items are logged. "
"Normally, use default value, or \"0\" to disable logging."
msgstr ":ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>`：记录内容的位掩码。通常使用默认值，或设为「0」禁用日志记录。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:29
#: 559c8464e36f4c469a0156dc5356f6a2
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_DISARMED<LOG_DISARMED>`: Setting to 1 will start logging when "
"power is applied, rather than at the first arming of the vehicle. Useful "
"when debugging pre-arm failures. Setting to 2 will only log on power "
"application other than USB power to prevent logging while setting up on the "
"bench. Setting to 3 will also erase any log in which the vehicle does not "
"proceed to the armed stated. This prevents accumulating numerous logs while "
"configuring on the bench or at the field. See "
":ref:`LOG_DARM_RATEMAX<LOG_DARM_RATEMAX>` also for managing log file sizes "
"while logging disarmed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOG_DISARMED<LOG_DISARMED>`：设为1时将在上电时即开始记录日志，而非在首次解锁时。适用于调试解锁前失败。设为2则仅在非USB供电上电时记录日志，以防止在台架调试时记录。设为3还会删除飞行器未进入解锁状态的日志，避免在台架或现场配置时积累大量日志。另见"
" :ref:`LOG_DARM_RATEMAX<LOG_DARM_RATEMAX>` 以管理上锁状态下记录时的日志文件大小。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:30
#: 3285404a60924df28472f5f62e0dcf75
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_FILE_DSRMROT<LOG_FILE_DSRMROT>`: Setting this bit will force the "
"creation of a new log file after disarming, waiting 15 seconds, and then re-"
"arming. Normally, a log will be one file for every power cycle of the "
"autopilot, beginning upon first arm."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOG_FILE_DSRMROT<LOG_FILE_DSRMROT>`：设置此位将在上锁后等待15秒、再次解锁时强制创建新日志文件。通常情况下，每次飞控上电对应一个日志文件，从首次解锁开始。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:31
#: 1d0a9eafe1ba4b1ea957116959268680
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_FILE_MB_FREE<LOG_FILE_MB_FREE>`: This parameter sets the minimum "
"free space on the logging media before logging begins. If this is not "
"available, then older logs will be deleted to provide it during "
"initialization. Default is 500MB."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOG_FILE_MB_FREE<LOG_FILE_MB_FREE>`：该参数设置日志开始前存储介质所需的最小可用空间。若空间不足，初始化时将删除较旧的日志来提供所需空间。默认值为500MB。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:32
#: c3f2dd80a24548ecbabc076fc2b92925
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_FILE_RATEMAX<LOG_FILE_RATEMAX>`: This sets the maximum rate that "
"streaming log messages will be logged to the file backend to limit file "
"sizes. A value of zero(default) means no limit is applied to normal logging,"
" which depends on the :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` value ( 50Hz: "
"Plane, 300Hz: QuadPlane/Rover, 400Hz: Copter, normally). Note that "
"similarly, :ref:`LOG_BLK_RATEMAX<LOG_BLK_RATEMAX>` and "
":ref:`LOG_MAV_RATEMAX<LOG_MAV_RATEMAX>` perform the same optional limiting "
"for the BLOCK logging and MAVLink logging streams, respectively."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOG_FILE_RATEMAX<LOG_FILE_RATEMAX>`：设置流式日志消息写入文件后端的最大速率，以限制文件大小。默认值为零（不限制），即正常记录速率取决于"
" :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` 值（Plane通常50Hz，QuadPlane/Rover "
"300Hz，Copter 400Hz）。类似地，:ref:`LOG_BLK_RATEMAX<LOG_BLK_RATEMAX>` 和 "
":ref:`LOG_MAV_RATEMAX<LOG_MAV_RATEMAX>` 分别对BLOCK日志和MAVLink日志流执行相同的可选限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:33
#: 53668f0b628d4428876903cf7047c913
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_MAX_FILES<LOG_MAX_FILES>`: The maximum number of log file that "
"will be written on dataflash or SD card before starting to rotate log "
"number. Limit is a maximum of 500 logs."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOG_MAX_FILES<LOG_MAX_FILES>`：在dataflash或SD卡上开始轮转日志编号前可写入的最大日志文件数。上限为500个日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:35
#: 768ef11dfd2e45f285946178f741a916
msgid ""
"If you suspect that you are missing logging entries due to excessive logging"
" speed, you can check the DSF.Dp log message for the amount of missed "
"entries."
msgstr "如果您怀疑因日志记录速度过快而丢失日志条目，可检查DSF.Dp日志消息了解丢失条目的数量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:37
#: dd1c0b4837e646f98db588ce30666ac8
msgid ""
"Logging of the continuously streaming log messages, such as attitude, "
"sensors, etc. can be paused by using the ``RCx_OPTION`` auxiliary function "
"\"164\" on a transmitter channel. Switching this channel high will pause "
"these messages, but not events, mode changes, warnings, etc. This allows "
"autopilots with limited logging capabilites (ie using Block logging to chip "
"memory and no SD card) to log only when desired during the flight, as during"
" tuning phases or determination of TECs parameters, etc. You can also "
"eliminate unneeded log messages using :ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>` to "
"reduce log size"
msgstr ""
"连续流式日志消息（如姿态、传感器等）的记录可通过遥控器通道上的 ``RCx_OPTION`` "
"辅助功能「164」暂停。将该通道拨高将暂停这些消息，但不影响事件、模式变化、警告等。这使得日志记录能力有限的飞控（如使用Block日志写入芯片内存且无SD卡）仅在飞行中需要时记录，如调参阶段或确定TECS参数等。您也可以使用"
" :ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>` 去除不需要的日志消息以减小日志大小"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:40
#: 4a9d9c7a90084f88bdfd75aa3c1a0e6a
msgid "Replay Logging"
msgstr "回放日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:42
#: 47a939c15ed04787b7da4760bbf454c4
msgid ""
"ArduPilot has the ability to log in a fashion that solutions to EKF/AHRS "
"issues can be more easily verified by actually re-playing a log against code"
" changes to see if the solution results in the desired, corrected behavior. "
"This requires that the logs showing the issue to be worked on be made with "
"logging active during disarmed periods (with "
":ref:`LOG_DISARMED<LOG_DISARMED>` set to a non-zero value, preferably 3) and"
" :ref:`LOG_REPLAY<LOG_REPLAY>` =1 , thereby logging more sensor data than "
"normal."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot具备以特定方式记录日志的能力，从而可以通过将日志回放到代码变更来更方便地验证EKF/AHRS问题的解决方案，以查看方案是否产生了期望的纠正行为。这需要在上锁状态下（将"
" :ref:`LOG_DISARMED<LOG_DISARMED>` 设为非零值，最好为3）且 "
":ref:`LOG_REPLAY<LOG_REPLAY>` =1 的条件下记录展示问题的日志，从而记录比正常更多的传感器数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:45
#: 5fc74242edae41eca842bc2ba21f5109
msgid "SD Card Logging Issues"
msgstr "SD卡日志问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:47
#: 4eb3331968b44f84bc7de96aa1ab9f65
msgid ""
"If you are running into problems with bad logging errors on SD cards, here "
"are some things you can try."
msgstr "如果您遇到SD卡日志错误问题，以下是一些可以尝试的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:49
#: 7cf46739df4b4c69978c8e016f664869
msgid ""
"Format the card to FAT32 or vFAT (newer formats can work with new versions "
"of Ardupilot and better hardware)."
msgstr "将SD卡格式化为FAT32或vFAT（新版格式在新版ArduPilot和更好的硬件上也可正常工作）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:50
#: b4bfd3354ebd40d9b953852f075af926
msgid "Perform a full format to check for bad sectors."
msgstr "执行完整格式化以检查坏扇区。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:51
#: c47e31ba709d4636880ced3421eea9ae
msgid "Check that the card is not write protected."
msgstr "检查SD卡是否未写保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:52
#: 5f5de9cf0ad3434b8e13c1842f487c7e
msgid "Check card contacts."
msgstr "检查SD卡触点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:53
#: eb99a45ee0484a8fae72d0dc6cd629fe
msgid "Some cards are problematic, try using a different one."
msgstr "某些SD卡存在问题，请尝试更换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:54
#: 1496d60aa01147c2bb3ead579b64cad8
msgid ""
"Ensure that the card is fast enough to keep up with logging demands (Class "
"10 works for many, but lower speeds can work too)."
msgstr "确保SD卡速度足以满足日志记录需求（Class 10适用于大多数情况，但较低速度也可能有效）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:55
#: b9699d8e659c4963a8ecd0d0cac5f798
msgid "Reduce the amount of data included with the logs in LOG_BITMASK."
msgstr "通过LOG_BITMASK减少日志中包含的数据量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:56
#: 33fc2e99eb7c409cbc75337264afd652
msgid ""
"Incrementally increase BRD_SD_SLOWDOWN up to a maximum of 32 (default is 0)."
msgstr "逐步增大BRD_SD_SLOWDOWN，最大值为32（默认值为0）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:59
#: 3322bd3b533544e9964d4dffedbf115c
msgid "On-Board DataFlash Logging"
msgstr "机载DataFlash日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:61
#: aefc3f8c3c41406db38d5df269a0dbf8
msgid ""
"Some boards do not have SD card interfaces for logging, but rather a limited"
" amount of dataflash, typically 16MB. This saves log files in a manner like "
"a circular buffer. Once the flash is filled, the oldest log file is "
"overwritten with the current logging data. If there is only one file on the "
"flash when space runs out, logging is stopped instead."
msgstr ""
"某些控制板没有SD卡接口用于日志记录，而是具有有限的dataflash存储，通常为16MB。该存储以循环缓冲方式保存日志文件。一旦闪存存满，最旧的日志文件将被当前日志数据覆盖。若闪存空间耗尽时只有一个文件，则停止日志记录。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:63
#: 2cc06995624845909b11ddf7df71f9c3
msgid ""
"A new log file will be started after boot, upon arming, or, immediately if "
":ref:`LOG_DISARMED<LOG_DISARMED>` is 1."
msgstr "新日志文件将在启动后、解锁后，或在 :ref:`LOG_DISARMED<LOG_DISARMED>` 为1时立即启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:65
#: 6baf48a456094e3189786182a8123c56
msgid ""
"If :ref:`LOG_FILE_DSRMROT<LOG_FILE_DSRMROT>` is enabled, any disarm will "
"stop logging and a new file started upon the next arm or immediately if "
":ref:`LOG_DISARMED<LOG_DISARMED>` is 1. Otherwise, logging to the current "
"file will resume on a re-arm. Any reboot stops logging to the current file."
msgstr ""
"若启用了 :ref:`LOG_FILE_DSRMROT<LOG_FILE_DSRMROT>`，任何上锁动作都会停止日志记录，并在下次解锁时或在 "
":ref:`LOG_DISARMED<LOG_DISARMED>` "
"为1时立即启动新文件。否则，重新解锁后将继续记录到当前文件。任何重启都会停止记录当前文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:67
#: 9eefa92082744b029729a6174a423ead
msgid ""
"In order to maximize the utility of the limited flash space several things "
"can be done:"
msgstr "为最大化利用有限闪存空间，可采取以下措施："

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:69
#: b4f534130545426ba77f8c092813420d
msgid "Reduce the things logged using :ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>`."
msgstr "使用 :ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>` 减少记录内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:70
#: 46d7e31da9e24fc1842284d61eea0356
msgid ""
"Eliminate logging the EKF3 messages which are voluminous and usually needed "
"only for problem diagnosis using the :ref:`EK3_LOG_LEVEL<EK3_LOG_LEVEL>` "
"parameter."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`EK3_LOG_LEVEL<EK3_LOG_LEVEL>` "
"参数消除EKF3消息的记录——EKF3消息数量庞大，通常仅在问题诊断时才需要。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:71
#: 26492b425ec84faca70ae60e3b4b374d
msgid ""
"Only log when needed during the flight, ie tuning, gathering data for TECS "
"tuning, etc. using an RC Aux switch set to \"164\" to start and stop log "
"writes."
msgstr "仅在飞行中需要时记录，如调参、收集TECS调参数据等，使用设为「164」的RC辅助开关控制日志写入的开始和停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:72
#: cef3659fb5904b35a06798808e0938fe
msgid ""
"Reduce the logging rate to a slower rate (below 10Hz) by setting "
":ref:`LOG_BLK_RATEMAX<LOG_BLK_RATEMAX>` which is by default unrestricted."
msgstr ""
"通过设置 :ref:`LOG_BLK_RATEMAX<LOG_BLK_RATEMAX>` （默认不受限）将日志记录速率降低到较慢的速率（低于10Hz）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:73
#: 92bcfae2cb9f4528b7f0a289b31c336e
msgid ""
"Download and erase the logs each flight and only log one file for a flight"
msgstr "每次飞行后下载并清除日志，且每次飞行只记录一个文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:75
#: 5a541c04266646c191a6ce9ffa245111
msgid ""
"some dataflash chips are particularly slow, leading to gaps in the logs. "
"Setting :ref:`LOG_BLK_RATEMAX<LOG_BLK_RATEMAX>` to a lower value can help "
"eliminate these gaps."
msgstr ""
"某些dataflash芯片速度较慢，导致日志出现空白。将 :ref:`LOG_BLK_RATEMAX<LOG_BLK_RATEMAX>` "
"设为较低值有助于消除这些空白。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:80
#: 821ea11147334dcdb2f52dc87478a624
msgid "Downloading logs via MAVLink"
msgstr "通过MAVLink下载日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:82
#: 0202984ae5ed4d6da2f16ee80c249d08
msgid "Connect your vehicle to the ground station using the micro USB cable"
msgstr "使用micro USB线将飞行器连接到地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:83
#: f828a78333c0420393cec39ff3463d57
msgid "Open the Mission Planner's Flight Data screen"
msgstr "打开Mission Planner的飞行数据界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner.rst:84
#: 09c6aca1ca7e4867bf51c59c50d1059e
